    "title": "Increase Key in a Max Heap",
    "category": "Heap",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "Given a valid Max Heap represented as an array, an index i, and a new value greater than or equal to the current value, update the key at index i and restore the Max Heap property. Print the updated heap.",
